(303829, 22129, 6999, '<td valign="top">As a de-saturated photo this is OK - but the absolutely head-on lighting doesn''t help you for me: I''d like to see some shape to the pill, it could almost be a cardboard cut-out here. The contrast of texture could also be brought out more - which would make an interesting parallel with a real and constructed world.</td>', 'As a de-saturated photo this is OK - but the absolutely head-on lighting doesn''t help you for me: I''d like to see some shape to the pill, it could almost be a cardboard cut-out here. The contrast of texture could also be brought out more - which would make an interesting parallel with a real and constructed world.', '2003-05-21 06:54:11.000000', NULL, 1),
