(303837, 21785, 6999, '<td valign="top">I like this being of a child rather than an adult - has great overtones of the implication of the idea. Not at all sure about the ''pills'' - look like lumps of plasticene, to the extent that they distract a little. Technically, I''d have tried a little gentle fill-in on the face - then you could have lessened the exposure a little to prevent those slight over-exposure artefacts on the hands (but only very slight). Nice work.</td>', 'I like this being of a child rather than an adult - has great overtones of the implication of the idea. Not at all sure about the ''pills'' - look like lumps of plasticene, to the extent that they distract a little. Technically, I''d have tried a little gentle fill-in on the face - then you could have lessened the exposure a little to prevent those slight over-exposure artefacts on the hands (but only very slight). Nice work.', '2003-05-21 07:05:48.000000', NULL, 1),
