(303873, 22030, 8760, '<td valign="top">Great idea...great realisation !!!</td>', 'Great idea...great realisation !!!', '2003-05-21 08:32:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(303874, 22017, 8139, '<td valign="top">Original idea, well done.<br/>I''m not sure to understand the connection to the theme.<br/>Love it anyway</td>', 'Original idea, well done.I''m not sure to understand the connection to the theme.Love it anyway', '2003-05-21 08:32:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(303875, 21846, 8139, '<td valign="top">Nice esthetic. Sharp shot with nice colours and reflections. Subtle background color. I love it.</td>', 'Nice esthetic. Sharp shot with nice colours and reflections. Subtle background color. I love it.', '2003-05-21 08:37:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(303886, 22068, 6999, '<td valign="top">Reflections on the clock are annoying - as is cropping out the handset cable. Also think you''ve placed the elements to far to the edge of the frame - just outside the thirds lines if you like - but the empty space seems too much the subject of this shot.</td>', 'Reflections on the clock are annoying - as is cropping out the handset cable. Also think you''ve placed the elements to far to the edge of the frame - just outside the thirds lines if you like - but the empty space seems too much the subject of this shot.', '2003-05-21 08:57:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(303890, 22014, 6999, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot. Obviously relevant, but in the end just falls between abstract and representative: the background doesn''t seeem to serve much purpose to me - too blurred to place the shot, too busy just to give a depth to the focus.</td>', 'Interesting shot. Obviously relevant, but in the end just falls between abstract and representative: the background doesn''t seeem to serve much purpose to me - too blurred to place the shot, too busy just to give a depth to the focus.', '2003-05-21 09:01:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(303891, 22065, 6999, '<td valign="top">The high-key is good here, and obviously the elements are appropriate. I have a problem with the composition of the subjects though - kind of too busy to get the clean techno effect that the high-key lighting seems to call for, but lacking the detail that might make it more interesting.</td>', 'The high-key is good here, and obviously the elements are appropriate. I have a problem with the composition of the subjects though - kind of too busy to get the clean techno effect that the high-key lighting seems to call for, but lacking the detail that might make it more interesting.', '2003-05-21 09:04:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(303892, 21678, 8009, '<td valign="top">Great idea. I think this was the idea I was looking for, but never thought of myself :-) Good job.<br/></td>', 'Great idea. I think this was the idea I was looking for, but never thought of myself :-) Good job.', '2003-05-21 09:05:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(303893, 22065, 6663, '<td valign="top">Nice touch of irony in this shot - good crisp focus on the foreground elements.</td>', 'Nice touch of irony in this shot - good crisp focus on the foreground elements.', '2003-05-21 09:06:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(303894, 22132, 1570, '<td valign="top">great graphic quality in this picture! 8</td>', 'great graphic quality in this picture! 8', '2003-05-21 09:06:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(303895, 21846, 772, '<td valign="top">excellent work... great creativity and well thought out shot... = 10</td>', 'excellent work... great creativity and well thought out shot... = 10', '2003-05-21 09:07:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(303896, 21967, 6663, '<td valign="top">This shot could have been a lot more effective (for me) if I couldn''t read the Photoshop caption at the top. Regardless, a good idea.</td>', 'This shot could have been a lot more effective (for me) if I couldn''t read the Photoshop caption at the top. Regardless, a good idea.', '2003-05-21 09:07:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(303897, 22134, 8009, '<td valign="top">This is my favourite so far. Great idea and well done.<br/></td>', 'This is my favourite so far. Great idea and well done.', '2003-05-21 09:07:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(303898, 22200, 6663, '<td valign="top">Excellent green hue you''ve given everything here - very matrix-y. A nice idea for the shot - slightly off the general theme of pastiche from the film. Good work.</td>', 'Excellent green hue you''ve given everything here - very matrix-y. A nice idea for the shot - slightly off the general theme of pastiche from the film. Good work.', '2003-05-21 09:08:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(303900, 22160, 6363, '<td valign="top">Grainy, and the DVD is back to front.</td>', 'Grainy, and the DVD is back to front.', '2003-05-21 09:09:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(303901, 22014, 5925, '<td valign="top">I love the colors, I love the closeup detail... and is that really Trinity in there or a model?!  Whoever it is... dead on!  Awesome idea too.</td>', 'I love the colors, I love the closeup detail... and is that really Trinity in there or a model?!  Whoever it is... dead on!  Awesome idea too.', '2003-05-21 09:09:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(303903, 22017, 6363, '<td valign="top">Nice. More star trek than matrix ?</td>', 'Nice. More star trek than matrix ?', '2003-05-21 09:10:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(303904, 22064, 6663, '<td valign="top">Well-taken shot - you''ve done well to get the image of the phone reflected on the shades. The focus is excellent too.<br/> <br/>Not sure about the layout of the shot with the black borders - I guess it''s very ''widescreen'' :) and ties in with the film, but I''m not so keen - I feel it''s a little unbalanced.<br/> <br/>Nice work nonetheless - I expect this will do well.</td>', 'Well-taken shot - you''ve done well to get the image of the phone reflected on the shades. The focus is excellent too. Not sure about the layout of the shot with the black borders - I guess it''s very ''widescreen'' :) and ties in with the film, but I''m not so keen - I feel it''s a little unbalanced. Nice work nonetheless - I expect this will do well.', '2003-05-21 09:11:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(303905, 22095, 6363, '<td valign="top">a maggot ?</td>', 'a maggot ?', '2003-05-21 09:11:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(303906, 22132, 6363, '<td valign="top">nice photo, a bit weak on theme though.</td>', 'nice photo, a bit weak on theme though.', '2003-05-21 09:12:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(303907, 22132, 5925, '<td valign="top">Wow, that guy is a dead ringer for an agent.  I absolutely LOVE how the cement in front of him makes X''s, and has water on it... and how the fence makes V''s.  Very good photo, I hope it makes it to the top 3!</td>', 'Wow, that guy is a dead ringer for an agent.  I absolutely LOVE how the cement in front of him makes X''s, and has water on it... and how the fence makes V''s.  Very good photo, I hope it makes it to the top 3!', '2003-05-21 09:12:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(303909, 21835, 6663, '<td valign="top">A slightly abstract take on the theme...? Nice image though.</td>', 'A slightly abstract take on the theme...? Nice image though.', '2003-05-21 09:13:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(303910, 21660, 6663, '<td valign="top">If the blur is deliberate, I\''m not sure it adds anything to this picture. I appreciate what you\''ve tried to do here but I think crisp focus would have helped...</td>', 'If the blur is deliberate, I\''m not sure it adds anything to this picture. I appreciate what you\''ve tried to do here but I think crisp focus would have helped...', '2003-05-21 09:13:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(303912, 21752, 6363, '<td valign="top">Nice. Give the caretaker a pat on the back for polishing.</td>', 'Nice. Give the caretaker a pat on the back for polishing.', '2003-05-21 09:14:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(303913, 22028, 6363, '<td valign="top">yuk</td>', 'yuk', '2003-05-21 09:15:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(303915, 22073, 6363, '<td valign="top">almost a close encounter</td>', 'almost a close encounter', '2003-05-21 09:15:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(303916, 22198, 6663, '<td valign="top">Hmm, yes. Good point! I expect the film will make more $$''s than ££''s, but it''s nice to see good old British cynicism shining through the hype :)</td>', 'Hmm, yes. Good point! I expect the film will make more $$''s than ££''s, but it''s nice to see good old British cynicism shining through the hype :)', '2003-05-21 09:15:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(303917, 21670, 6363, '<td valign="top">nice on theme</td>', 'nice on theme', '2003-05-21 09:15:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(303918, 22206, 6663, '<td valign="top">Lovely perspective, and awell-chosen border - brings the colours out without stifling the shot. Of what is this a picture?</td>', 'Lovely perspective, and awell-chosen border - brings the colours out without stifling the shot. Of what is this a picture?', '2003-05-21 09:16:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(303921, 22169, 6363, '<td valign="top">interesting idea</td>', 'interesting idea', '2003-05-21 09:16:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(303922, 22039, 6363, '<td valign="top">nice hand</td>', 'nice hand', '2003-05-21 09:17:24.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(303923, 22028, 6663, '<td valign="top">Computer programmer, by any chance???</td>', 'Computer programmer, by any chance???', '2003-05-21 09:17:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(303924, 22084, 6363, '<td valign="top">nice kid, nice pic, poor theme</td>', 'nice kid, nice pic, poor theme', '2003-05-21 09:17:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(303925, 21754, 6363, '<td valign="top">i''d buy that for a dollar !!</td>', 'i''d buy that for a dollar !!', '2003-05-21 09:18:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(303926, 22025, 6663, '<td valign="top">This shot is ever so small - it''s tough to make out what''s in it, which ultimately detracts from the mark. Sorry - try and make the shots a little larger before submitting. There are forum posts about this...<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2003-05-28 04:20:19.</i></td>', 'This shot is ever so small - it''s tough to make out what''s in it, which ultimately detracts from the mark. Sorry - try and make the shots a little larger before submitting. There are forum posts about this...', '2003-05-21 09:18:27.000000', '2003-05-28 05:20:19.000000', 1),
(303928, 21812, 6363, '<td valign="top">i like it. fun, smooth and well taken.</td>', 'i like it. fun, smooth and well taken.', '2003-05-21 09:19:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(303929, 22042, 6663, '<td valign="top">The heavy use of colourisation in this shot has left it rather grainy. I like the structure of the shot, but I''m not keen on the texture.</td>', 'The heavy use of colourisation in this shot has left it rather grainy. I like the structure of the shot, but I''m not keen on the texture.', '2003-05-21 09:19:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(303930, 21897, 6363, '<td valign="top">no comment</td>', 'no comment', '2003-05-21 09:19:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(303933, 22235, 6363, '<td valign="top">motorway hell ?</td>', 'motorway hell ?', '2003-05-21 09:20:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(303934, 21778, 6363, '<td valign="top">i''m out of focus</td>', 'i''m out of focus', '2003-05-21 09:20:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(303935, 22205, 6663, '<td valign="top">*groan* Terrible puns. But an amusing take on the theme. Perhaps pandering to those who felt the Matrix was an ''unhealthy'' choice for the challenge?</td>', '*groan* Terrible puns. But an amusing take on the theme. Perhaps pandering to those who felt the Matrix was an ''unhealthy'' choice for the challenge?', '2003-05-21 09:20:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(303937, 21958, 6363, '<td valign="top">yeah, i like it !</td>', 'yeah, i like it !', '2003-05-21 09:21:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(303940, 21972, 6363, '<td valign="top">funny, close on theme, nice picture</td>', 'funny, close on theme, nice picture', '2003-05-21 09:21:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(303941, 22170, 6663, '<td valign="top">Great effect. Did you project this image onto the bottle?<br/> <br/>Extremely artistic work - clever.</td>', 'Great effect. Did you project this image onto the bottle? Extremely artistic work - clever.', '2003-05-21 09:22:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(303942, 21979, 6663, '<td valign="top">Very striking effect you''ve brought out in this pic.</td>', 'Very striking effect you''ve brought out in this pic.', '2003-05-21 09:23:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(303943, 22109, 6663, '<td valign="top">Interesting comment you''re making here.</td>', 'Interesting comment you''re making here.', '2003-05-21 09:23:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(303944, 22126, 6663, '<td valign="top">I think this shot could have been lit a little better. It''s a little grainy, and I don''t really see how the shot refers to the title.<br/> <br/>But a good idea - I don''t mean to be negative about this shot, there''s definite potential here.</td>', 'I think this shot could have been lit a little better. It''s a little grainy, and I don''t really see how the shot refers to the title. But a good idea - I don''t mean to be negative about this shot, there''s definite potential here.', '2003-05-21 09:25:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(303945, 22089, 6663, '<td valign="top">A well thought-out shot. Good idea.</td>', 'A well thought-out shot. Good idea.', '2003-05-21 09:25:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(303948, 21837, 6663, '<td valign="top">Great shot! Clever way of hitting the challenge without resorting to pastiche. I''m curious as to how this was done - is the laptop resting on a printed sheet of paper?<br/> <br/>Very clever anyway - 8.</td>', 'Great shot! Clever way of hitting the challenge without resorting to pastiche. I''m curious as to how this was done - is the laptop resting on a printed sheet of paper? Very clever anyway - 8.', '2003-05-21 09:27:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(303950, 22046, 6663, '<td valign="top">Very clever. I think you could have cropped this to either include the whole spoon, or none of it, at the bottom of the shot. But it''s a very clever idea - albeit one that only a fan of the film will truly ''get''.<br/> <br/>There is no spoon....</td>', 'Very clever. I think you could have cropped this to either include the whole spoon, or none of it, at the bottom of the shot. But it''s a very clever idea - albeit one that only a fan of the film will truly ''get''. There is no spoon....', '2003-05-21 09:29:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(303951, 22134, 6663, '<td valign="top">Clever shot, well-taken.</td>', 'Clever shot, well-taken.', '2003-05-21 09:29:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(303953, 22086, 6663, '<td valign="top">I''m curious as to how this was achieved - I''ll be watching out for the comments when the challenge is done! Effective shot.</td>', 'I''m curious as to how this was achieved - I''ll be watching out for the comments when the challenge is done! Effective shot.', '2003-05-21 09:31:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(303954, 22161, 6663, '<td valign="top">Interesting history/technology contrast here. A slightly quirkier idea than most this week.</td>', 'Interesting history/technology contrast here. A slightly quirkier idea than most this week.', '2003-05-21 09:33:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(303955, 21807, 6663, '<td valign="top">Very effective. Clever idea, good title. One of the better entries this week.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2003-05-28 03:58:18.</i></td>', 'Very effective. Clever idea, good title. One of the better entries this week.', '2003-05-21 09:33:37.000000', '2003-05-28 04:58:18.000000', 1),
(303956, 21958, 6663, '<td valign="top">I think you mean ''deceit''. Regardless, clever idea, and a well-taken photo. Like the way you''ve kept the Matrix-style green/b&amp;w in without resorting to computer screens. Good stuff, keep it up.</td>', 'I think you mean ''deceit''. Regardless, clever idea, and a well-taken photo. Like the way you''ve kept the Matrix-style green/b&w in without resorting to computer screens. Good stuff, keep it up.', '2003-05-21 09:34:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(303957, 22118, 4735, '<td valign="top">hahahaha good</td>', 'hahahaha good', '2003-05-21 09:35:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(303958, 21783, 6663, '<td valign="top">Pity you couldn''t have found a Duracell like in the film... :)</td>', 'Pity you couldn''t have found a Duracell like in the film... :)', '2003-05-21 09:35:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(303959, 22129, 6663, '<td valign="top">Well-coloured shot - I can see why you didn''t choose to get the red pill in there too... :)<br/> <br/></td>', 'Well-coloured shot - I can see why you didn''t choose to get the red pill in there too... :) ', '2003-05-21 09:36:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(303960, 22025, 7743, '<td valign="top">This is a cool shot from the underside of a mushroom though the center is overexposed and the picture is too small to see any detail elseware.  A different vantage point may have allowed you to keep the center out of the center to add interest.</td>', 'This is a cool shot from the underside of a mushroom though the center is overexposed and the picture is too small to see any detail elseware.  A different vantage point may have allowed you to keep the center out of the center to add interest.', '2003-05-21 09:38:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(303962, 22239, 6663, '<td valign="top">Wow - a literal take on the theme! Very rare this week :). It''s a nice shot, if staged - you get some credit just for daring to not take a pic of someone in shades this week!<br/> <br/>I certainly can''t fault your photo relating to the title, and from that, the theme. Good work.</td>', 'Wow - a literal take on the theme! Very rare this week :). It''s a nice shot, if staged - you get some credit just for daring to not take a pic of someone in shades this week! I certainly can''t fault your photo relating to the title, and from that, the theme. Good work.', '2003-05-21 09:40:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(303964, 22056, 6663, '<td valign="top">In your attempt to add the green tint, you''ve washed the shot out a little - perhaps it''s overdone a bit.<br/> <br/>Good idea though - I definitely see where you''re coming from.</td>', 'In your attempt to add the green tint, you''ve washed the shot out a little - perhaps it''s overdone a bit. Good idea though - I definitely see where you''re coming from.', '2003-05-21 09:43:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(303965, 21677, 6663, '<td valign="top">Beautiful minimalist shot - very well done, great contrast between the two cables, and you''ve even got the green tint in there! Extremely competent photography. Like it.</td>', 'Beautiful minimalist shot - very well done, great contrast between the two cables, and you''ve even got the green tint in there! Extremely competent photography. Like it.', '2003-05-21 09:44:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(303966, 21574, 6663, '<td valign="top">A nice take on the theme - steering clear of references to the film. Well done.</td>', 'A nice take on the theme - steering clear of references to the film. Well done.', '2003-05-21 09:45:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(303968, 22231, 6663, '<td valign="top">You''ve done very well to get this shot - pity you couldn''t have brought uot the blue on the left a little more. A good pastiche.</td>', 'You''ve done very well to get this shot - pity you couldn''t have brought uot the blue on the left a little more. A good pastiche.', '2003-05-21 09:47:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(303969, 21967, 8139, '<td valign="top">too easy, sorry</td>', 'too easy, sorry', '2003-05-21 09:47:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(303970, 22150, 6663, '<td valign="top">Do you know what? I can read ''Starburst'' on the blue pill - pity, kind of shatters the illusion a bit!<br/> <br/>But a good shot - obvious relevance to the film. Nicely composed too.</td>', 'Do you know what? I can read ''Starburst'' on the blue pill - pity, kind of shatters the illusion a bit! But a good shot - obvious relevance to the film. Nicely composed too.', '2003-05-21 09:48:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(303971, 22171, 6663, '<td valign="top">A little abstract to really link to the theme, for me at least. It''s a nice photo but I feel no real relevance to the challenge.</td>', 'A little abstract to really link to the theme, for me at least. It''s a nice photo but I feel no real relevance to the challenge.', '2003-05-21 09:48:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(303973, 22225, 6663, '<td valign="top">It''s a little indistinct - the lack of light in the shot makes it kind of hard to see what you''re trying to shot here. <br/> <br/>I have to admit to being a little baffled about the theme of this shot - have I missed something, or is there a Matrix character who''s terrified of flowers? That''s the idea i get when I look at this...<br/> <br/>On a more positive note, I like the ''double-image'' thing you''ve created here on the RHS. Nice.</td>', 'It''s a little indistinct - the lack of light in the shot makes it kind of hard to see what you''re trying to shot here.  I have to admit to being a little baffled about the theme of this shot - have I missed something, or is there a Matrix character who''s terrified of flowers? That''s the idea i get when I look at this... On a more positive note, I like the ''double-image'' thing you''ve created here on the RHS. Nice.', '2003-05-21 09:51:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(303976, 22108, 7743, '<td valign="top">A better angle on the clips would give this image more interest.  Also, it seams a little overexposed and out of focus.</td>', 'A better angle on the clips would give this image more interest.  Also, it seams a little overexposed and out of focus.', '2003-05-21 09:52:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(303977, 22014, 6663, '<td valign="top">Wow - I''d believe this was actually a shot from the film itself! You don''t know Carrie-Anne Moss personally, do you?<br/> <br/>Very well done to catch such a distinct reflection on the telephone handset. Usually I don''t like shots with these kind of dimensions but they work perfectly here. Even the green tint is spot-on. Very good work.</td>', 'Wow - I''d believe this was actually a shot from the film itself! You don''t know Carrie-Anne Moss personally, do you? Very well done to catch such a distinct reflection on the telephone handset. Usually I don''t like shots with these kind of dimensions but they work perfectly here. Even the green tint is spot-on. Very good work.', '2003-05-21 09:53:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(303978, 22151, 7743, '<td valign="top">Lots of moire happening here.  Nice idea though.</td>', 'Lots of moire happening here.  Nice idea though.', '2003-05-21 09:53:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(303981, 21890, 6663, '<td valign="top">This is a little /too/ abstract for my liking - I don\''t really see \''mech\'', just shapes. It\''s nice to look at but this isn\''t really my kind of thing. Sorry.</td>', 'This is a little /too/ abstract for my liking - I don\''t really see \''mech\'', just shapes. It\''s nice to look at but this isn\''t really my kind of thing. Sorry.', '2003-05-21 09:54:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(303984, 22172, 7743, '<td valign="top">The bullet looks like it''s suspended rather than moving.  I don''t know how you could of shown that, maybe on a pendelum?  Otherwise the composition and choice of exposure works here.</td>', 'The bullet looks like it''s suspended rather than moving.  I don''t know how you could of shown that, maybe on a pendelum?  Otherwise the composition and choice of exposure works here.', '2003-05-21 09:56:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(303985, 22076, 6663, '<td valign="top">Really crisp, clear white in this shot - very tricky to do, as I''ve found myself in the past. The red looks a little over-saturated, but it''s a nice shot. Well composed.</td>', 'Really crisp, clear white in this shot - very tricky to do, as I''ve found myself in the past. The red looks a little over-saturated, but it''s a nice shot. Well composed.', '2003-05-21 09:56:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(303986, 22110, 7743, '<td valign="top">I like the colours but the bright white is a little distracting.</td>', 'I like the colours but the bright white is a little distracting.', '2003-05-21 09:57:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(303987, 21837, 7743, '<td valign="top">Funny.</td>', 'Funny.', '2003-05-21 09:57:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(303988, 21678, 6663, '<td valign="top">Now that is very smart. Brilliant, I love it. Superb idea, very creative thinking. I''m stunned by how clever this shot is. Great title too.<br/> <br/>My top pic this week. A (very rare) 10. Hope to see this place very high.</td>', 'Now that is very smart. Brilliant, I love it. Superb idea, very creative thinking. I''m stunned by how clever this shot is. Great title too. My top pic this week. A (very rare) 10. Hope to see this place very high.', '2003-05-21 09:58:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(303989, 22165, 6663, '<td valign="top">...covered in maple syrup?</td>', '...covered in maple syrup?', '2003-05-21 10:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(303990, 22063, 6663, '<td valign="top">This works very well. Nice shot.</td>', 'This works very well. Nice shot.', '2003-05-21 10:00:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(303992, 22233, 6663, '<td valign="top">:) Yes, looks like it does have this guy...</td>', ':) Yes, looks like it does have this guy...', '2003-05-21 10:01:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(303994, 22212, 6663, '<td valign="top">Kind of bizarre idea - but I like it.</td>', 'Kind of bizarre idea - but I like it.', '2003-05-21 10:03:53.000000', NULL, 1),
