(304072, 22235, 2978, '<td valign="top">Cool, very cool to be exact. I love this kind of abstract and you''ve done a good job. My only comment is that I would try rotating the image counterclockwise a bit to make those line vertical.</td>', 'Cool, very cool to be exact. I love this kind of abstract and you''ve done a good job. My only comment is that I would try rotating the image counterclockwise a bit to make those line vertical.', '2003-05-21 11:30:47.000000', NULL, 1),
