(304112, 21673, 6008, '<td valign="top">I dont seem to know what that is, but that could be a good thing. It looks futuristic, and the colors/curves are appealing. It''s simple and clean. The shadows add something too. Only negatives are the two ''spots'' - one in the top right and the other just below the curve. And the background white seems a little dull.</td>', 'I dont seem to know what that is, but that could be a good thing. It looks futuristic, and the colors/curves are appealing. It''s simple and clean. The shadows add something too. Only negatives are the two ''spots'' - one in the top right and the other just below the curve. And the background white seems a little dull.', '2003-05-21 12:01:53.000000', NULL, 1),
