(304125, 21670, 6008, '<td valign="top">This certainly has the matrix feel and meets the challenge. The negative space on the right is good. Not meaning this in a bad way or attacking the model, but I think the ''blotchy'' skin is a little distracting. The forehead line above the glasses is a little washed out/over exposed as well. I''m curious to know how it would look with the entire matrix ''lettering'' filling the glasses frame, but this way gives it the ''white room'' look.</td>', 'This certainly has the matrix feel and meets the challenge. The negative space on the right is good. Not meaning this in a bad way or attacking the model, but I think the ''blotchy'' skin is a little distracting. The forehead line above the glasses is a little washed out/over exposed as well. I''m curious to know how it would look with the entire matrix ''lettering'' filling the glasses frame, but this way gives it the ''white room'' look.', '2003-05-21 12:15:01.000000', NULL, 1),
