(304133, 22108, 6008, '<td valign="top">I''m not a fan of guns but in the context of the challenge and what is represents, this works. The choice of b&amp;w has more of an impact and it is in keeping with the ''loading room''. The few background shadows are a little distracting, but not overly so. The tight crop with the guns continuing out of the frame helps give the illusion that there are many many more of them.</td>', 'I''m not a fan of guns but in the context of the challenge and what is represents, this works. The choice of b&w has more of an impact and it is in keeping with the ''loading room''. The few background shadows are a little distracting, but not overly so. The tight crop with the guns continuing out of the frame helps give the illusion that there are many many more of them.', '2003-05-21 12:25:57.000000', NULL, 1),
