(304210, 22064, 7778, '<td valign="top">Topical, graphic, well rendered and likely ''intentional clichee''. The wide screen effect with the white hairline separation is especially apt. A bit too ''slick'' and vacuous, perhaps, for the artistically discriminate.</td>', 'Topical, graphic, well rendered and likely ''intentional clichee''. The wide screen effect with the white hairline separation is especially apt. A bit too ''slick'' and vacuous, perhaps, for the artistically discriminate.', '2003-05-21 13:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
