(304216, 22177, 7778, '<td valign="top">Hey, the background shot alone is a treat. <br/> <br/>What I like is the ephemeral quality underlying the scripted plane, blur, swaths and all. The green is as subtle as hues on an old Japanese triptych. Wonderful!</td>', 'Hey, the background shot alone is a treat.  What I like is the ephemeral quality underlying the scripted plane, blur, swaths and all. The green is as subtle as hues on an old Japanese triptych. Wonderful!', '2003-05-21 14:10:16.000000', NULL, 1),
