(304357, 22143, 7778, '<td valign="top">I found this shot difficult to rate. It''s obviously a dramatic capture with considerable range (I''m thinking of the cozy tungsten window glow vs. the cold street lights and lightning flashes). <br/>The  topicality of this shot, however, asks for a liberal interpretation of the matrix. <br/> <br/>On reflection, I think it should not loose any points for this, since, at least, I am grateful that the range of choices is only extended by this contribution.</td>', 'I found this shot difficult to rate. It''s obviously a dramatic capture with considerable range (I''m thinking of the cozy tungsten window glow vs. the cold street lights and lightning flashes). The  topicality of this shot, however, asks for a liberal interpretation of the matrix.  On reflection, I think it should not loose any points for this, since, at least, I am grateful that the range of choices is only extended by this contribution.', '2003-05-21 15:05:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(304362, 21882, 7273, '<td valign="top">Can''t look at it too long or i''ll go crosseyed! Very cool picture!</td>', 'Can''t look at it too long or i''ll go crosseyed! Very cool picture!', '2003-05-21 15:17:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(304364, 21671, 7778, '<td valign="top">I found this shot difficult to rate. <br/> <br/>As opposed to most other pieces, this one is (refreshingly) high on ''content''. It, simply, provokes more thought and debate than one with a ''slick'' or ''vogue'' feel to it. From an artistic perspective, I think, what is remarkable here, is the fact that technical skill and measure has been subordinated to content. This, IMO, makes a classic, i.e. something that will endure time.</td>', 'I found this shot difficult to rate.  As opposed to most other pieces, this one is (refreshingly) high on ''content''. It, simply, provokes more thought and debate than one with a ''slick'' or ''vogue'' feel to it. From an artistic perspective, I think, what is remarkable here, is the fact that technical skill and measure has been subordinated to content. This, IMO, makes a classic, i.e. something that will endure time.', '2003-05-21 15:19:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(304368, 22017, 7778, '<td valign="top">Perfect, topical, slick (although... ''slick'' may be an attribute befitting ''the other side''). <br/> <br/>The duotone works wonderfully well.</td>', 'Perfect, topical, slick (although... ''slick'' may be an attribute befitting ''the other side'').  The duotone works wonderfully well.', '2003-05-21 15:28:11.000000', NULL, 1),
