(304621, 22064, 4494, '<td valign="top">Cool idea for the border.  For this shot I LIKE IT a lot, and it really fits.  Maybe make the black border a little thinner.</td>', 'Cool idea for the border.  For this shot I LIKE IT a lot, and it really fits.  Maybe make the black border a little thinner.', '2003-05-21 22:02:29.000000', NULL, 1),
