(304627, 22063, 4494, '<td valign="top">That is so freakin cool I can''t believe it!!!!!  I absolutely love the contrast between the screen and the white face!  And the sun glasses are great!  You''re the winner so far.  Good luck.</td>', 'That is so freakin cool I can''t believe it!!!!!  I absolutely love the contrast between the screen and the white face!  And the sun glasses are great!  You''re the winner so far.  Good luck.', '2003-05-21 22:32:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(304630, 22205, 4494, '<td valign="top">LMAO that''s so funny!  Good job and well done as well!  8.</td>', 'LMAO that''s so funny!  Good job and well done as well!  8.', '2003-05-21 22:34:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(304632, 21652, 4494, '<td valign="top">Well done shot, the lighting is great.  I like the focus on the front portion of the board and leaving the rest blurry in this case.  Good choice!</td>', 'Well done shot, the lighting is great.  I like the focus on the front portion of the board and leaving the rest blurry in this case.  Good choice!', '2003-05-21 22:36:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(304635, 22160, 4007, '<td valign="top">I like the setup.. and using the backwards cd with a mirror was a great idea, but I think the grain on this shot really takes away from the result.  I''m not sure if it was intentional, but I think a sharp shot of this setup would work out better.</td>', 'I like the setup.. and using the backwards cd with a mirror was a great idea, but I think the grain on this shot really takes away from the result.  I''m not sure if it was intentional, but I think a sharp shot of this setup would work out better.', '2003-05-21 22:39:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(304636, 22068, 4494, '<td valign="top">Is that a real clock?  Can''t be because it would be inaccurate since there''s more distance between the 12 and 1 then there is between, say, the 2 and 3.  Very nice setup and great looking phone.</td>', 'Is that a real clock?  Can''t be because it would be inaccurate since there''s more distance between the 12 and 1 then there is between, say, the 2 and 3.  Very nice setup and great looking phone.', '2003-05-21 22:40:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(304639, 21678, 4494, '<td valign="top">Yeah baby, that''s really great!</td>', 'Yeah baby, that''s really great!', '2003-05-21 22:46:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(304642, 22210, 4007, '<td valign="top">Nice witty entry.  The green tones are a plus.  And I love how the cord really looks like it is peering up at the viewer. Great work. 8</td>', 'Nice witty entry.  The green tones are a plus.  And I love how the cord really looks like it is peering up at the viewer. Great work. 8', '2003-05-21 22:53:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(304644, 22065, 7570, '<td valign="top">i dont know, but i think we cannot disconnect from the matrix thru a mobile connection, it''s not secure : ) A tighter focus on the numpads will make a higher score.</td>', 'i dont know, but i think we cannot disconnect from the matrix thru a mobile connection, it''s not secure : ) A tighter focus on the numpads will make a higher score.', '2003-05-21 22:56:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(304645, 22233, 7570, '<td valign="top">the model is convincing, but could be better. good protrayal</td>', 'the model is convincing, but could be better. good protrayal', '2003-05-21 23:01:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(304647, 22225, 8056, '<td valign="top">Sorry, my light bulb was already burned.</td>', 'Sorry, my light bulb was already burned.', '2003-05-21 23:10:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(304648, 21807, 8056, '<td valign="top">Sharp and clear. The palm still can be showing so clearly from the picture even close-up shooting. I guess the lightning from the shooting place was not enough at all, still the hand can be turn-out so clear with less lightning. The spoon !! U got power of bending down the spoon, causing that curve, is it? I salute you. ^ ^ what a great MATRIX pic !! 7</td>', 'Sharp and clear. The palm still can be showing so clearly from the picture even close-up shooting. I guess the lightning from the shooting place was not enough at all, still the hand can be turn-out so clear with less lightning. The spoon !! U got power of bending down the spoon, causing that curve, is it? I salute you. ^ ^ what a great MATRIX pic !! 7', '2003-05-21 23:20:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(304649, 22010, 7570, '<td valign="top">i personally like this shot a lot, it gives a warm feeling about it. a contrast from the other "techy" shots in this challenge. However, take note of the slight over exposure on the lady''s shadow. a 6</td>', 'i personally like this shot a lot, it gives a warm feeling about it. a contrast from the other "techy" shots in this challenge. However, take note of the slight over exposure on the lady''s shadow. a 6', '2003-05-21 23:21:17.000000', NULL, 1),
