(304702, 22026, 4007, '<td valign="top">I can''t really make out what''s going on, and I wish the shot was maxed out to the available dimensions.. but this is a very cool shot, as it looks like reality is definately being stretched here.</td>', 'I can''t really make out what''s going on, and I wish the shot was maxed out to the available dimensions.. but this is a very cool shot, as it looks like reality is definately being stretched here.', '2003-05-22 00:20:19.000000', NULL, 1),
