(304711, 22063, 4007, '<td valign="top">Nice work.. it took me a second to figure out that this was a screen with water on it.. the effect is very cool.</td>', 'Nice work.. it took me a second to figure out that this was a screen with water on it.. the effect is very cool.', '2003-05-22 00:27:55.000000', NULL, 1),
