(304722, 21652, 4007, '<td valign="top">I like the harsh contrast and the black and white with only hints of color showing, although perhaps a green focus color would have been preferable to the blue... although I do see tha tyou worked green into the rest of the piece nicely.</td>', 'I like the harsh contrast and the black and white with only hints of color showing, although perhaps a green focus color would have been preferable to the blue... although I do see tha tyou worked green into the rest of the piece nicely.', '2003-05-22 00:37:38.000000', NULL, 1),
