(304822, 22225, 4517, '<td valign="top">Scared of flowers! Are you a big girl or do you have hayfever? I know what your saying there have been alot of flower pics lately but flowers make great subjects.<br/>As for this photo. Well it`s not the best and not the worst so i`ll give you 5. Good luck.</td>', 'Scared of flowers! Are you a big girl or do you have hayfever? I know what your saying there have been alot of flower pics lately but flowers make great subjects.As for this photo. Well it`s not the best and not the worst so i`ll give you 5. Good luck.', '2003-05-22 05:44:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(304825, 21807, 6999, '<td valign="top">Good shot - worked a little on something similar myself. I think the code is a bit obvious, not sure it was necessary to quote directly from the film imagery, though I guess just a bent spoon wouldn''t be understood by those who don''t know the film. Two minor points: the scratches on the spoon are a pity (they make it a real world object, which is perhaps out of place in such a photo), and the organisation of the fingers is a touch distracting - but they''re minor points.</td>', 'Good shot - worked a little on something similar myself. I think the code is a bit obvious, not sure it was necessary to quote directly from the film imagery, though I guess just a bent spoon wouldn''t be understood by those who don''t know the film. Two minor points: the scratches on the spoon are a pity (they make it a real world object, which is perhaps out of place in such a photo), and the organisation of the fingers is a touch distracting - but they''re minor points.', '2003-05-22 05:48:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(304827, 22039, 4517, '<td valign="top">Maybe should have bent the spoon.</td>', 'Maybe should have bent the spoon.', '2003-05-22 05:49:14.000000', NULL, 1),
