(305193, 21837, 7291, '<td valign="top">Now, THAT''S creative.  Good job.  I have to be totally honest and say that this deosn''t really say "Matrix" to me because you can basically put anything on the screen and title the picture accordingly.  However, the creativity and composition can''t be ignored and this will get very high marks from me.</td>', 'Now, THAT''S creative.  Good job.  I have to be totally honest and say that this deosn''t really say "Matrix" to me because you can basically put anything on the screen and title the picture accordingly.  However, the creativity and composition can''t be ignored and this will get very high marks from me.', '2003-05-22 19:09:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(305194, 22221, 7291, '<td valign="top">I''m not too comfortable see a shotgun in the hands of a child, escpecially being from Colorado and having memories of Columbine, but I understand that it''s purely for the sake of the picture.  That being said, I feel the focus is too soft.  The shutter speed appears to have been too slow based on the motion blur evident on the shotgun.</td>', 'I''m not too comfortable see a shotgun in the hands of a child, escpecially being from Colorado and having memories of Columbine, but I understand that it''s purely for the sake of the picture.  That being said, I feel the focus is too soft.  The shutter speed appears to have been too slow based on the motion blur evident on the shotgun.', '2003-05-22 19:13:09.000000', NULL, 1),
