(305554, 21846, 6999, '<td valign="top">Like this very much. Not sure that there is quite enough DOF - the focus is just drifting on the far edge of the ''thing'', but not enough to make it seem deliberate. Reflections are good, the lines and composition are excellent. The subject: perhaps too representative rather than interpretive for me.</td>', 'Like this very much. Not sure that there is quite enough DOF - the focus is just drifting on the far edge of the ''thing'', but not enough to make it seem deliberate. Reflections are good, the lines and composition are excellent. The subject: perhaps too representative rather than interpretive for me.', '2003-05-23 06:54:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(305556, 22222, 6999, '<td valign="top">Gee there''s a lot of circuit-board shots in this challenge, and a lot of green shots. This is in the top half - but the high contrast is bugging me, and it took a while t see the jack. Actually it looks more blue than green now ... :-)</td>', 'Gee there''s a lot of circuit-board shots in this challenge, and a lot of green shots. This is in the top half - but the high contrast is bugging me, and it took a while t see the jack. Actually it looks more blue than green now ... :-)', '2003-05-23 06:57:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(305557, 22155, 6999, '<td valign="top">:-) Rather desperate attempt to put across your relevance. Like it. The photo - not enough definition on the fossils (lighting?), and the untidy positioning of the text is a pity. Made me smile though.</td>', ':-) Rather desperate attempt to put across your relevance. Like it. The photo - not enough definition on the fossils (lighting?), and the untidy positioning of the text is a pity. Made me smile though.', '2003-05-23 07:05:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(305560, 22047, 6999, '<td valign="top">Intersting angles here - took me a while to work out how the background must be positioned. I think these shots need to be cleaner - or the noise more exaggerated - whereas here it looks like a problem rather than a advantage.</td>', 'Intersting angles here - took me a while to work out how the background must be positioned. I think these shots need to be cleaner - or the noise more exaggerated - whereas here it looks like a problem rather than a advantage.', '2003-05-23 07:21:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(305564, 22210, 6999, '<td valign="top">Great detail and texture on the top of whatever that is! really tactile. Like the curves and patterns too. It''s a power cable, yes? Took me a while to work it out. Good shooting.</td>', 'Great detail and texture on the top of whatever that is! really tactile. Like the curves and patterns too. It''s a power cable, yes? Took me a while to work it out. Good shooting.', '2003-05-23 07:23:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(305565, 21752, 6999, '<td valign="top">Like this for this challenge: has a number of compositional elements from the film, though the red is out of place.</td>', 'Like this for this challenge: has a number of compositional elements from the film, though the red is out of place.', '2003-05-23 07:26:46.000000', NULL, 1),
