(306035, 22177, 2978, '<td valign="top">I like you got away from that The Matrix scheme. But I wich the figure was more serious.</td>', 'I like you got away from that The Matrix scheme. But I wich the figure was more serious.', '2003-05-24 12:08:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(306038, 22063, 7628, '<td valign="top">very interesting idea - I like the "digitizing" effect the wire screen gives, and the miriad reflections in the water drops.  Many choices of how to look at things, and wonder what is real - and the one real thing is out of focus.  Fits the challenge well, and it is a good photo - well composed with the black glasses balancing the black coat. 9</td>', 'very interesting idea - I like the "digitizing" effect the wire screen gives, and the miriad reflections in the water drops.  Many choices of how to look at things, and wonder what is real - and the one real thing is out of focus.  Fits the challenge well, and it is a good photo - well composed with the black glasses balancing the black coat. 9', '2003-05-24 12:15:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(306040, 22170, 7628, '<td valign="top">Interesting to see this detail in a beer bottle - good eye.  the banding of the glue on the lable looks like the matrix code, the ameoba like shape looks like an embryo.  The out of focus lable in the forground is distracting - tho an important clue so I''d have cropped the right half of the pict out, and cropped a top slice that includes the curve of white - I think it would give a more focussed effect - more of the Matrix theme you see in the bottle, and less of the bottle itself</td>', 'Interesting to see this detail in a beer bottle - good eye.  the banding of the glue on the lable looks like the matrix code, the ameoba like shape looks like an embryo.  The out of focus lable in the forground is distracting - tho an important clue so I''d have cropped the right half of the pict out, and cropped a top slice that includes the curve of white - I think it would give a more focussed effect - more of the Matrix theme you see in the bottle, and less of the bottle itself', '2003-05-24 12:21:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(306111, 22097, 4517, '<td valign="top">Could maybe have shown more of the spoon.</td>', 'Could maybe have shown more of the spoon.', '2003-05-24 16:39:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(306112, 22014, 4517, '<td valign="top">Good idea. Green could be a bit brighter. 6</td>', 'Good idea. Green could be a bit brighter. 6', '2003-05-24 16:41:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(306113, 22008, 4517, '<td valign="top">Good effect. 7</td>', 'Good effect. 7', '2003-05-24 16:42:25.000000', NULL, 1),
