(306126, 22017, 4517, '<td valign="top">Brilliant photo. Top 3</td>', 'Brilliant photo. Top 3', '2003-05-24 17:16:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(306130, 21678, 4517, '<td valign="top">Now that is a brilliant idea and photo. 10. Must be a ribbon.</td>', 'Now that is a brilliant idea and photo. 10. Must be a ribbon.', '2003-05-24 17:31:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(306189, 22148, 8274, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting, just underexposed.</td>', 'Nice lighting, just underexposed.', '2003-05-24 22:56:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(306193, 22030, 7628, '<td valign="top">Just saw reloaded tonight - yes you do portray the portal well - is this the bottom of a green bottle with a cut-out Neo?  I like the color - the ripples of color eminating from the "door" - a creative interpretation</td>', 'Just saw reloaded tonight - yes you do portray the portal well - is this the bottom of a green bottle with a cut-out Neo?  I like the color - the ripples of color eminating from the "door" - a creative interpretation', '2003-05-24 23:13:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(306197, 22144, 7628, '<td valign="top">I appreciate any entry that isn''t trying to mimic a still from the movie  - and this is an interesting photo.  True the matrix could allow you to have any reality you wish - are we supposed to imagine what we cannot see here?  Are we held back from true reality  by this mesh?  I wish the mesh were more regular - mechanical, and the figure in the back more interestingly posed.</td>', 'I appreciate any entry that isn''t trying to mimic a still from the movie  - and this is an interesting photo.  True the matrix could allow you to have any reality you wish - are we supposed to imagine what we cannot see here?  Are we held back from true reality  by this mesh?  I wish the mesh were more regular - mechanical, and the figure in the back more interestingly posed.', '2003-05-24 23:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(306201, 22114, 7628, '<td valign="top">A more interesting battery composition than others.  You have imaged a primitive matix - is this where it all begins?</td>', 'A more interesting battery composition than others.  You have imaged a primitive matix - is this where it all begins?', '2003-05-24 23:22:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(306203, 22233, 7628, '<td valign="top">I like the tilt of the composition - the dice are loaded, choice is an illusion.  I wish you would have set up the shot so that the phone and light were not in the background - just the machines and this lone lost soul.</td>', 'I like the tilt of the composition - the dice are loaded, choice is an illusion.  I wish you would have set up the shot so that the phone and light were not in the background - just the machines and this lone lost soul.', '2003-05-24 23:25:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(306204, 22143, 7628, '<td valign="top">A dramatic photo - I don''t see a stong connection to the matrix, but thats just me.  I like the black of the buildings and the different colors of the lights inside and out - the brilliant blue hanging overhead with the lightning.</td>', 'A dramatic photo - I don''t see a stong connection to the matrix, but thats just me.  I like the black of the buildings and the different colors of the lights inside and out - the brilliant blue hanging overhead with the lightning.', '2003-05-24 23:27:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(306207, 21897, 7628, '<td valign="top">A good question -   True - the images and spinoffs and products from the movie have created an ever growing matrix of their own...<br/>Would be nicer to have the human subject in sharp focus, I''m trying to think what would be a better way to crop this so it looks a bit tidier - cohesive</td>', 'A good question -   True - the images and spinoffs and products from the movie have created an ever growing matrix of their own...Would be nicer to have the human subject in sharp focus, I''m trying to think what would be a better way to crop this so it looks a bit tidier - cohesive', '2003-05-24 23:33:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(306210, 21837, 7628, '<td valign="top">A humerous idea - well done (this is the leaning tower od Pisa technique, yes?) You did the lighting well enough that it looks very convincing</td>', 'A humerous idea - well done (this is the leaning tower od Pisa technique, yes?) You did the lighting well enough that it looks very convincing', '2003-05-24 23:38:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(306216, 21979, 6999, '<td valign="top">In a way, I can''t see this as an interpretation of the movie - however, I like it so much that hardly matters: it has an impression of the effects from the film. Love the colours, the motion (is it a multi-exposure?), and the wierdness of the viewpoint. would have done wonderfully in the transportation challenge. 8</td>', 'In a way, I can''t see this as an interpretation of the movie - however, I like it so much that hardly matters: it has an impression of the effects from the film. Love the colours, the motion (is it a multi-exposure?), and the wierdness of the viewpoint. would have done wonderfully in the transportation challenge. 8', '2003-05-25 00:01:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(306273, 21752, 7969, '<td valign="top">Well, I am not sure of the link to matrix, but I do like your perspective in this shot and it is in focus and sharp</td>', 'Well, I am not sure of the link to matrix, but I do like your perspective in this shot and it is in focus and sharp', '2003-05-25 01:17:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(306275, 22086, 7969, '<td valign="top">Very interesting shot, hope you tell us how you did it after the challenge. It is creative and seems appropriate to theme.</td>', 'Very interesting shot, hope you tell us how you did it after the challenge. It is creative and seems appropriate to theme.', '2003-05-25 01:19:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(306276, 21672, 7969, '<td valign="top">May have fit theme more if used marshall arts weapons vs. painting tools  :  )</td>', 'May have fit theme more if used marshall arts weapons vs. painting tools  :  )', '2003-05-25 01:20:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(306281, 21959, 8701, '<td valign="top">This is a great photo, I love how well everything is situated and the use of coulours, = 9</td>', 'This is a great photo, I love how well everything is situated and the use of coulours, = 9', '2003-05-25 01:28:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(306283, 22118, 7969, '<td valign="top"><br/> <br/> <br/> <br/> <br/> <br/> <br/> <br/> <br/> <br/> <br/> <br/> <br/> <br/> <br/> <br/> <br/> <br/> <br/> <br/> <br/> <br/> <br/> <br/> <br/> <br/> <br/> <br/> <br/> <br/> <br/> <br/> <br/> <br/> <br/> <br/> <br/> <br/> <br/> <br/> <br/> <br/> <br/> <br/>Mostly I have been bored by the phone/glasses shots, but this one gave me a good chuckle thanks!  Is also technically well done.<br/> <br/> <br/>o</td>', '                                           Mostly I have been bored by the phone/glasses shots, but this one gave me a good chuckle thanks!  Is also technically well done.  o', '2003-05-25 01:30:38.000000', NULL, 1),
