(306474, 22162, 6771, '<td valign="top">Not quite sure on the significance, but would be a much better photo if more in focus (around the middle falls area).  With the rain coming down on the water, had alot more "texture" to it</td>', 'Not quite sure on the significance, but would be a much better photo if more in focus (around the middle falls area).  With the rain coming down on the water, had alot more "texture" to it', '2003-05-25 18:02:44.000000', NULL, 1),
