(306482, 22210, 4411, '<td valign="top">Nice. I like this a lot.<br/>Composition is great, and the lighting on the plug end makes it stand out so well.<br/>Great shot, well done. 10</td>', 'Nice. I like this a lot.Composition is great, and the lighting on the plug end makes it stand out so well.Great shot, well done. 10', '2003-05-25 18:43:30.000000', NULL, 1),
