(306494, 22064, 4411, '<td valign="top">Great detail and colour on this, and I don''t usually comment on frames but damn that one works well!<br/>The overall composition lets this down for me - the arrangement is a bit too much like a face.</td>', 'Great detail and colour on this, and I don''t usually comment on frames but damn that one works well!The overall composition lets this down for me - the arrangement is a bit too much like a face.', '2003-05-25 19:26:02.000000', NULL, 1),
