(306587, 21574, 4793, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors and the design, the front part I would like to see more in focus, very nice, please IM me and tell me what your subject is.</td>', 'Beautiful colors and the design, the front part I would like to see more in focus, very nice, please IM me and tell me what your subject is.', '2003-05-25 23:07:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(306588, 21796, 7628, '<td valign="top">Nice line up of batteries, creates a bit of depth.  Would be better lit more from the front too.  Wish it weren''t cropped at the bottom - cutting off the bottom of the batteries</td>', 'Nice line up of batteries, creates a bit of depth.  Would be better lit more from the front too.  Wish it weren''t cropped at the bottom - cutting off the bottom of the batteries', '2003-05-25 23:08:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(306589, 22014, 7628, '<td valign="top">I like the idea of the reflection in the phone - the entrance to and exit from the Matrix.  It is so narrow a crop - do you mean to suggest the difficulty of entering and exiting? - a narrow door? I think it would work better with a diffent composition revealing more of the structure of the phone.</td>', 'I like the idea of the reflection in the phone - the entrance to and exit from the Matrix.  It is so narrow a crop - do you mean to suggest the difficulty of entering and exiting? - a narrow door? I think it would work better with a diffent composition revealing more of the structure of the phone.', '2003-05-25 23:12:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(306590, 22017, 2586, '<td valign="top">Creative idea. Don''t understand the Red Note since i pretty much figured out how you did this. Nice shot, good composition, good choice of B&amp;W., you lost it a bit though on the hand to the right of the handheld. Are you that whacky guy from Ottawa by any chance? :) 7</td>', 'Creative idea. Don''t understand the Red Note since i pretty much figured out how you did this. Nice shot, good composition, good choice of B&W., you lost it a bit though on the hand to the right of the handheld. Are you that whacky guy from Ottawa by any chance? :) 7', '2003-05-25 23:13:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(306591, 22238, 7628, '<td valign="top">nice green light.  Good interpretation of the theme - a mind linked to the matrix isn''t free.  Perhaps a more diagonal composition would have implied the action of freeing the mind better?</td>', 'nice green light.  Good interpretation of the theme - a mind linked to the matrix isn''t free.  Perhaps a more diagonal composition would have implied the action of freeing the mind better?', '2003-05-25 23:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(306593, 22220, 7628, '<td valign="top">The image fractured by the mirrors is an interesting interpretation - what is real?  But this composition is too busy - the eye doesn''t know where to look.</td>', 'The image fractured by the mirrors is an interesting interpretation - what is real?  But this composition is too busy - the eye doesn''t know where to look.', '2003-05-25 23:17:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(306594, 22160, 7628, '<td valign="top">an interesting effect.  I''m not sure whatit accomplishes - but I like being able to see through the disc, like the green and blue highlights</td>', 'an interesting effect.  I''m not sure whatit accomplishes - but I like being able to see through the disc, like the green and blue highlights', '2003-05-25 23:20:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(306596, 22066, 2586, '<td valign="top">This is a great portrait and fantastic lighting. I just LOVE the abstract pattern of the light creating greenish shapes on her (leather?) coat. The logo of her t-shirt is very clear and the rest of her clothing is pleasantly soft and barely recognizable. Great composition as well.  This is done with good studio lighting!  Is this magnetic by any chance? 10</td>', 'This is a great portrait and fantastic lighting. I just LOVE the abstract pattern of the light creating greenish shapes on her (leather?) coat. The logo of her t-shirt is very clear and the rest of her clothing is pleasantly soft and barely recognizable. Great composition as well.  This is done with good studio lighting!  Is this magnetic by any chance? 10', '2003-05-25 23:22:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(306597, 21958, 7628, '<td valign="top">Very nice idea - fits the "movie" matrix theme without being an image of pills, guns, batteries or Neo. Much appreciated!  It is a beautiful web!  I''m sorry the green hue shift made those strange green patches on the rocks, it is distracting - but what can you do?</td>', 'Very nice idea - fits the "movie" matrix theme without being an image of pills, guns, batteries or Neo. Much appreciated!  It is a beautiful web!  I''m sorry the green hue shift made those strange green patches on the rocks, it is distracting - but what can you do?', '2003-05-25 23:23:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(306598, 22165, 4285, '<td valign="top">Great lighting, great setup, border is a little distracting, maybe if the black was thinner, and the blood was just not bloody enough (little too orange - Heinz or Alymers?). Too bad because this was one of the better pics. 6</td>', 'Great lighting, great setup, border is a little distracting, maybe if the black was thinner, and the blood was just not bloody enough (little too orange - Heinz or Alymers?). Too bad because this was one of the better pics. 6', '2003-05-25 23:25:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(306600, 21972, 4793, '<td valign="top">Cute, funny, I like your idea for this challenge pic, nice</td>', 'Cute, funny, I like your idea for this challenge pic, nice', '2003-05-25 23:27:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(306601, 21754, 2586, '<td valign="top">Find your title slightly klutzy but your image is very creative What''s the background, a CD? Very nice color green, nice ''motion'' effect. And that big black border works very well! 8</td>', 'Find your title slightly klutzy but your image is very creative What''s the background, a CD? Very nice color green, nice ''motion'' effect. And that big black border works very well! 8', '2003-05-25 23:27:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(306602, 21846, 7628, '<td valign="top">Very nice image!  I like the distortion of the "matrix green code" around the opennings in the "interface"  I think I''d like to see a different crop - just a bit more on the bottom? 8</td>', 'Very nice image!  I like the distortion of the "matrix green code" around the opennings in the "interface"  I think I''d like to see a different crop - just a bit more on the bottom? 8', '2003-05-25 23:27:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(306605, 22097, 4793, '<td valign="top">Love it, diffferent</td>', 'Love it, diffferent', '2003-05-25 23:30:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(306606, 21979, 2586, '<td valign="top">Nice action shot, like the overall abstract collage feel that it creates. Too bad about all that black on lower left corner. 8</td>', 'Nice action shot, like the overall abstract collage feel that it creates. Too bad about all that black on lower left corner. 8', '2003-05-25 23:31:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(306614, 22239, 4793, '<td valign="top">This is beautiful, what a wonderful photo, looks like a painting...10</td>', 'This is beautiful, what a wonderful photo, looks like a painting...10', '2003-05-25 23:38:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(306621, 22132, 2586, '<td valign="top">This shot is cool and has a lot of power. It''s a nasty image and i like that. The nice patterns of the puddles on the squared terrace really help this shot a lot. Think though that i would have cropped it at the top edge of the puddles to give it more of a reading that ''so is the world''. You''ll probably get comments to move the guy slightly more to the left to agree with the &lt;yawn&gt; rule of thirds but where you have just blends in beautifully with the pattern of the puddles which was probably what you were going for. Good choice of B&amp;W. Technically, this is not the best shot among the submissions but this image has a lot of eeriness to it and to me, much more than all those sunglasses and blue and red pills, says Matrix to me (mind you though that i didn''t see the movie :) 9</td>', 'This shot is cool and has a lot of power. It''s a nasty image and i like that. The nice patterns of the puddles on the squared terrace really help this shot a lot. Think though that i would have cropped it at the top edge of the puddles to give it more of a reading that ''so is the world''. You''ll probably get comments to move the guy slightly more to the left to agree with the <yawn> rule of thirds but where you have just blends in beautifully with the pattern of the puddles which was probably what you were going for. Good choice of B&W. Technically, this is not the best shot among the submissions but this image has a lot of eeriness to it and to me, much more than all those sunglasses and blue and red pills, says Matrix to me (mind you though that i didn''t see the movie :) 9', '2003-05-25 23:44:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(306622, 21671, 2586, '<td valign="top">Am wondering whether this is a shot of two pictures. The top one definitely is but the bottom reads like a picture of a picture as well and therefore i like it a little less. Titles never enter my scoring but i don''t particularly care for titles that read like a book in order to understand the submission. 7</td>', 'Am wondering whether this is a shot of two pictures. The top one definitely is but the bottom reads like a picture of a picture as well and therefore i like it a little less. Titles never enter my scoring but i don''t particularly care for titles that read like a book in order to understand the submission. 7', '2003-05-25 23:48:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(306633, 22030, 2586, '<td valign="top">Nice and creepy. I like it! If you ask me, and i may be entirely wrong, i see a bit of foolery here :) A cutout cardboard figure and one of those industrial glass vases (i used one once for a submission) set on a nice reflective surface such as a highly polished table, glass, or a mirror. Just guessing. Would have liked it more if the top green shape would have been blackish as well to keep my eye on the center. 8</td>', 'Nice and creepy. I like it! If you ask me, and i may be entirely wrong, i see a bit of foolery here :) A cutout cardboard figure and one of those industrial glass vases (i used one once for a submission) set on a nice reflective surface such as a highly polished table, glass, or a mirror. Just guessing. Would have liked it more if the top green shape would have been blackish as well to keep my eye on the center. 8', '2003-05-26 00:02:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(306636, 22058, 2586, '<td valign="top">Nice image of a circuit board. It has the appropriate matrix green and, thank god, no sunglasses and no blue&amp;red pill. Like how the board fades away into black and into the black border. 8</td>', 'Nice image of a circuit board. It has the appropriate matrix green and, thank god, no sunglasses and no blue&red pill. Like how the board fades away into black and into the black border. 8', '2003-05-26 00:05:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(306639, 22086, 2586, '<td valign="top">Don''t see why this needed a Red Admin Note :) Poor model. Nice and creepy. 8</td>', 'Don''t see why this needed a Red Admin Note :) Poor model. Nice and creepy. 8', '2003-05-26 00:09:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(306643, 22056, 2586, '<td valign="top">Unsure what the relevance of this image is to the challenge but since i didn''t see the movie who am i to judge? :) This is a simple but the distortion of the reflection in the mirror is great. 7</td>', 'Unsure what the relevance of this image is to the challenge but since i didn''t see the movie who am i to judge? :) This is a simple but the distortion of the reflection in the mirror is great. 7', '2003-05-26 00:11:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(306644, 22148, 2586, '<td valign="top">Good image, good portrait in relation to the challenge. It might have been cool if you could have put just a bit more light on the hands to clearly show the red and blue pill significance but keeping the light on the face just as is. Overall i like the darkness and, much to my own loss in a prior submission, i do like dark images :) 8</td>', 'Good image, good portrait in relation to the challenge. It might have been cool if you could have put just a bit more light on the hands to clearly show the red and blue pill significance but keeping the light on the face just as is. Overall i like the darkness and, much to my own loss in a prior submission, i do like dark images :) 8', '2003-05-26 00:15:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(306645, 22209, 2586, '<td valign="top">Very slick. Very creepy. I like it! I might have cropped some of the black on the left off because it shifts the overall balance to the left away from the face. Then again, the image isn''t just about the face. Some of the light lighting around the nose and cheek bother me a little but i''m very forgiving when i''m being pleased.<br/> <br/>BTW, normally i leave a score with my comments and i had forgotten it here. It got a 9 from me (update 5/28)<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2003-05-28 21:23:50.</i></td>', 'Very slick. Very creepy. I like it! I might have cropped some of the black on the left off because it shifts the overall balance to the left away from the face. Then again, the image isn''t just about the face. Some of the light lighting around the nose and cheek bother me a little but i''m very forgiving when i''m being pleased. BTW, normally i leave a score with my comments and i had forgotten it here. It got a 9 from me (update 5/28)', '2003-05-26 00:21:14.000000', '2003-05-28 22:23:50.000000', 1),
(306647, 22118, 2586, '<td valign="top">Very nice collage and spooky (old Bill always gives me the creeps :) Nicely orchestrated, nice colors. Nitpick: would have done without the 1-2 px green stroke because it just makes the image unduly busy. There''s already a lot going on as is and i would have just let the image fade into a black border. I can''t figure out the significance of the old-fashioned telephone which has a prominent place here but maybe that was in the movie (which i didn''t see). 8</td>', 'Very nice collage and spooky (old Bill always gives me the creeps :) Nicely orchestrated, nice colors. Nitpick: would have done without the 1-2 px green stroke because it just makes the image unduly busy. There''s already a lot going on as is and i would have just let the image fade into a black border. I can''t figure out the significance of the old-fashioned telephone which has a prominent place here but maybe that was in the movie (which i didn''t see). 8', '2003-05-26 00:26:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(306652, 21890, 2586, '<td valign="top">Very nice abstract and i just LOVE abstracts. Great colors, great lighting, great ''motion-like'' effect in top right, nice blurring. All yummy, yummy to me. Hey, and thanks for not showing sunglasses and a red&amp;blue pill (didn''t see the movie but after having voted on all submissions i understand they figured BIG in the movie :)  10</td>', 'Very nice abstract and i just LOVE abstracts. Great colors, great lighting, great ''motion-like'' effect in top right, nice blurring. All yummy, yummy to me. Hey, and thanks for not showing sunglasses and a red&blue pill (didn''t see the movie but after having voted on all submissions i understand they figured BIG in the movie :)  10', '2003-05-26 00:31:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(306655, 22238, 2586, '<td valign="top">Well done. A nice tableau to think about in a mass of black. Like the irony of the title and the hand \''holding\'' the wires that have a \''hold\'' on the mind. The whites pop a little too much for my taste. Nice colors. With your set-up you convey a lot with an economy of props. I always like that. 8<br/>On second thoughts, and after having tweaked my votes, i''m upping this to a 9. I really like your message here and the way you presented it even though the popping whites still bother me (even in the thumbnail. 9</td>', 'Well done. A nice tableau to think about in a mass of black. Like the irony of the title and the hand \''holding\'' the wires that have a \''hold\'' on the mind. The whites pop a little too much for my taste. Nice colors. With your set-up you convey a lot with an economy of props. I always like that. 8On second thoughts, and after having tweaked my votes, i''m upping this to a 9. I really like your message here and the way you presented it even though the popping whites still bother me (even in the thumbnail. 9', '2003-05-26 00:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
