(308190, 22076, 7711, '<td valign="top">simplest and  most effective of all the red and blue pill entries. I like the stark whiteness of the background and the clean composition.</td>', 'simplest and  most effective of all the red and blue pill entries. I like the stark whiteness of the background and the clean composition.', '2003-05-27 20:41:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(308194, 22097, 7711, '<td valign="top">my favourite of all the spoon entries. I like the simple composition and clean lines. I wish the whole shadow was in the shot too, and wasn''t patchy. still, nicely done. 8</td>', 'my favourite of all the spoon entries. I like the simple composition and clean lines. I wish the whole shadow was in the shot too, and wasn''t patchy. still, nicely done. 8', '2003-05-27 20:45:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(308198, 22066, 7711, '<td valign="top">This is such a great composition. I love that she''s off to one side and looking over her shoulder..like something is there in the darkness. Subtle details like the green hue on her jacket and the reflection in her glasses really make this picture awesome. I like the focus and clean and smooth lines. Extremely well done. 10.</td>', 'This is such a great composition. I love that she''s off to one side and looking over her shoulder..like something is there in the darkness. Subtle details like the green hue on her jacket and the reflection in her glasses really make this picture awesome. I like the focus and clean and smooth lines. Extremely well done. 10.', '2003-05-27 20:48:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(308199, 22063, 7711, '<td valign="top">is this a grid with some water drops? its ingenius. Reminds me of those walls of tvs where each tv has its own picture but together they also make up a bigger picture. Very closer, with nice lines and just enough drops to keep the whole shot interesting without totally distorting the picture underneath. Cleverly done. :) 9</td>', 'is this a grid with some water drops? its ingenius. Reminds me of those walls of tvs where each tv has its own picture but together they also make up a bigger picture. Very closer, with nice lines and just enough drops to keep the whole shot interesting without totally distorting the picture underneath. Cleverly done. :) 9', '2003-05-27 20:50:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(308200, 22166, 7711, '<td valign="top">light and motion blurs can be a lot of fun, but I think here we need more clearly defined objects to know what we''re looking at. As well, the graininess/noisiness doesn''t really add anything to the shot. I''m afraid I cannot see the connection to the present challenge either. 1</td>', 'light and motion blurs can be a lot of fun, but I think here we need more clearly defined objects to know what we''re looking at. As well, the graininess/noisiness doesn''t really add anything to the shot. I''m afraid I cannot see the connection to the present challenge either. 1', '2003-05-27 20:52:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(308203, 22220, 7711, '<td valign="top">I''ve given this a 1. I think reflections are a great photographic subject, but here there is little meaning in the composition and I don''t see the attachment to the subject. Additionally, the shot itself suffers from distracting reflections, focus and noise problems and the tilt seems to serve little purpose in the composition other than to throw off the viewers perspective but without a solid point of attention. I applaud your efforts and hope you keep shooting and submitting. :)</td>', 'I''ve given this a 1. I think reflections are a great photographic subject, but here there is little meaning in the composition and I don''t see the attachment to the subject. Additionally, the shot itself suffers from distracting reflections, focus and noise problems and the tilt seems to serve little purpose in the composition other than to throw off the viewers perspective but without a solid point of attention. I applaud your efforts and hope you keep shooting and submitting. :)', '2003-05-27 20:55:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(308204, 21736, 7711, '<td valign="top">this pictures has soft colours and I am a sucker for high key. I like it. Reminds me of neurons, and it leaves a lot for the viewer to think about. Nicely done. 8</td>', 'this pictures has soft colours and I am a sucker for high key. I like it. Reminds me of neurons, and it leaves a lot for the viewer to think about. Nicely done. 8', '2003-05-27 20:56:23.000000', NULL, 1),
