(308297, 22177, 933, '<td valign="top">Interesting.  The typewriter overlay is a bit out of synch with the full matrix theme, but with no post processing, your options are limited, eh?  Nice effect.  9 md</td>', 'Interesting.  The typewriter overlay is a bit out of synch with the full matrix theme, but with no post processing, your options are limited, eh?  Nice effect.  9 md', '2003-05-27 22:21:19.000000', NULL, 1),
