(308797, 22162, 6202, '<td valign="top">So sad to see the scores on this now and to realize that there was a definate lack of creativity in the voters.  Directly from the movie the line is "Matrix a computerized dream."  <br/> <br/>That is exactly what I did, I took a photo of a waterfall which is part of my dream of a very relaxing place and I edited using a computer thus creating a computerized dream...sad that no one could think past the idea of the movie itself.</td>', 'So sad to see the scores on this now and to realize that there was a definate lack of creativity in the voters.  Directly from the movie the line is "Matrix a computerized dream."   That is exactly what I did, I took a photo of a waterfall which is part of my dream of a very relaxing place and I edited using a computer thus creating a computerized dream...sad that no one could think past the idea of the movie itself.', '2003-05-28 09:00:03.000000', NULL, 0),
