(310729, 21839, 6349, '<td valign="top">ive never heard of smarties?  i thought i had, but they dont look like those at all.  sorry about all the candy people. (i just read your rant in the forums).  i''d say the main problem with the shot is the lighting.  it especially doesnt have a matrix feel to it and the pill idea was used a lot so the candy prob didn''t work to your advantage.  you got good clarity and detail in the wrinkle lines in the skin and fingerprints.  the candies, however, do not look that tasty.</td>', 'ive never heard of smarties?  i thought i had, but they dont look like those at all.  sorry about all the candy people. (i just read your rant in the forums).  i''d say the main problem with the shot is the lighting.  it especially doesnt have a matrix feel to it and the pill idea was used a lot so the candy prob didn''t work to your advantage.  you got good clarity and detail in the wrinkle lines in the skin and fingerprints.  the candies, however, do not look that tasty.', '2003-05-30 08:18:32.000000', NULL, 0),
