(310866, 21839, 8060, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by bil99:</b></div><hr/><i>hey those look like M&amp;Ms to me...</i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Alot of you have commented about the similarity of M£Ms, well they are not M&amp;Ms they are most DEFINATLY smarties, which apparently you dont get in America, anyway i think most of you are missing the point of the challenge? MAtrix? anyway just thought id settle that.</td>', 'Originally posted by bil99:hey those look like M&Ms to me...  Alot of you have commented about the similarity of M£Ms, well they are not M&Ms they are most DEFINATLY smarties, which apparently you dont get in America, anyway i think most of you are missing the point of the challenge? MAtrix? anyway just thought id settle that.', '2003-05-30 12:46:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(310927, 22095, 7151, '<td valign="top">I knew I recognized that JP bulb!  I had my gall bladder out in January, had complications, and had one of those things hanging out of me for almost a month.  Was that not the weirdest sensation when they pull that thing out???  Sorry I couldn''t bring myself to score higher - the image just had too fresh and real-world a connotation for me to get past. :-)</td>', 'I knew I recognized that JP bulb!  I had my gall bladder out in January, had complications, and had one of those things hanging out of me for almost a month.  Was that not the weirdest sensation when they pull that thing out???  Sorry I couldn''t bring myself to score higher - the image just had too fresh and real-world a connotation for me to get past. :-)', '2003-05-30 14:43:51.000000', NULL, 0),
(310949, 22226, 8488, '<td valign="top">For what it''s worth, I gave it a 7, which for me means:<br/>(a) it fits the contest<br/>(b) it fits it pretty well<br/>(c) no blatant stupid technical flaws<br/>(d) no particular specific lighting/cropping/composition nitpicks that I can find<br/>(e) not completely boring and devoid of artistic interest<br/>(f) doesn''t leap out at me and make me say, ''Cool!''<br/> <br/>So there you are, an after-the-fact comment explaining my vote. :-&gt; Though I think you can see why I didn''t say so before. I didn''t have anything specific to say about it.</td>', 'For what it''s worth, I gave it a 7, which for me means:(a) it fits the contest(b) it fits it pretty well(c) no blatant stupid technical flaws(d) no particular specific lighting/cropping/composition nitpicks that I can find(e) not completely boring and devoid of artistic interest(f) doesn''t leap out at me and make me say, ''Cool!'' So there you are, an after-the-fact comment explaining my vote. :-> Though I think you can see why I didn''t say so before. I didn''t have anything specific to say about it.', '2003-05-30 15:48:38.000000', NULL, 0),
