(531503, 22219, 12223, '<td valign="top">Left hand thumb is too upright and the entire left hand is too low on the hold. The right hand trigger finger is correctly placed.  Appears to have had some training, just not enough or with the wrong trainer.  Mention to this model to research Massad Ayoob @ LFI (Lethal Force Institute).  Great tactical instructor for "real life" encounters.  Concentrates on the consequence of deadly force use, not just the mechanics of this particular martial art form.<br/> <br/>Nice use of negative image.</td>', 'Left hand thumb is too upright and the entire left hand is too low on the hold. The right hand trigger finger is correctly placed.  Appears to have had some training, just not enough or with the wrong trainer.  Mention to this model to research Massad Ayoob @ LFI (Lethal Force Institute).  Great tactical instructor for "real life" encounters.  Concentrates on the consequence of deadly force use, not just the mechanics of this particular martial art form. Nice use of negative image.', '2004-01-04 16:32:53.000000', NULL, 0),
